# UI Design

## Colour Scheme

The UniSwap platform uses a simple and clean colour scheme to ensure 
readability and ease of use for students. The selected colours provide good 
contrast and maintain a professional appearance. 


Primary Colour: Blue (#2D6CDF)
Secondary Colour: Light Grey (#F5F5F5)
Background Colour: White (#FFFFFF)
Text Colour: Black (#000000)
Button Colour: Green (#4CAF50)

